<h1>About runv.club</h1>

<p>runv.club is run by Pablo Murad (<a href="/~pmurad/">~pmurad</a>), from Brazil. He's the only one with root. Write to <a href="mailto:admin@runv.club">admin@runv.club</a> for anything about your account or the server.</p>

<h2>How it's built</h2>

<p>The whole server is set up from <a href="https://github.com/runvclub/runv.club">one public repository</a>, with Ansible. Nothing is changed by hand, so what you read there is what runs here. If you spot a hole, tell us before anyone else does.</p>

<h2>Suspensions and deletions</h2>

<p>Breaking the <a href="/rules">rules</a> gets an account suspended: you can't log in and your pages go dark, but nothing is deleted, and we write to tell you why. Serious cases get deleted. A deleted home is kept for 14 days in case it was a mistake, then it's gone.</p>

<h2>What it costs</h2>

